 to draw a background. PSD file or transparent image is preferred.\nIf possible, two expressions or more per character would be very helpful.\n\nPlease draw us in the outfits that are referenced in the folder. Either character can wear either outfit, please decide based on your preference!\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Kn_PrzxGLKsh_p7R8ULD_PKvp6BdjCPd?usp=drive_link\n\nPlease appeal the price if necessary!\nよろしくお願いします\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Q7ERDbfe6csbNGof0WlD-MVqMJx32gXb?usp=drive_link", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@c0cha0/works/20", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3574582, "client_id": 1074147, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c35df05b/uploads/origins/2438170d-2752-4ece-8e44-d9230cbb51e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cd2a5b06c369deaa70f2b5646111fb85", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c35df05b/uploads/origins/2438170d-2752-4ece-8e44-d9230cbb51e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5a6d58605a90f4cf85809409382460ba", "src_set": ""}, "body": "またまたこんにちは、あなたからの素晴らしい作品が大好きです。\nぜひ取り上げてください：Milphi (my OC) - https://skeb.jp/@c0cha0/works/5 .\nテーブルで楽しそうにしているMilphiが見たいです。\nこんな感じ：- https://skeb.jp/@hanamasa_ono/works/162 .\nミルフィの前のテーブルには、小さくて柔らかいチェリーケーキを置いてください。\nポーズや背景、その他詳細はお任せします。(テキストはありません)。\nありがとうございました！💕", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@c0cha0/works/19", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3574582, "client_id": 3391534, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c07373b8/uploads/origins/e48c5b55-f762-4c27-8ca6-7b0